#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#AEB: Autonomous Emergency Braking
#ACC: Automatic Cruise Control
#GVT: Global Vehicle Target
#VUT: Vehicle Under Test (ego vehicle)
#FCW: Forward Collision Warning
#LKAS: Lane-Keeping Assistance System
#
#This ACC example is unique to ACC testing in the Euro NCAP spec. It involves a vehicle starting in the same lane as the ego, then leaving the lane to avoid a stopped vehicle
#- The ego must avoid the stopped vehilcle that is revealed when the lead vehicle cuts-out of the lane
#- The cut-out  vehicle is traveling at 70 km/h
#- The ego is traveling at 90 km/h
